      "term": "C2C",
      "definition": "Corner-to-corner. A construction method that works small blocks of 3 dc diagonally from one corner to the opposite corner. The piece grows by adding one block each row on the way up, then removes one block each row on the way down."
    },
    {
      "slug": "c2c-block-g50",
      "term": "C2C block",
      "definition": "The basic unit of corner-to-corner work: 3 dc worked into a chain-3 space, with a chain 3 to bridge to the next block. Colour changes happen at the block level."
    }
